        <span id="mechanisms-detail" class="text-muted">Hydrostatic equilibrium ΔP = ρ·g·H balances 103.8 kPa steam pressure against 12.2m water column at 85°C (density 968 kg/m³). Net safety head is +1.22m.</span>
      </div>
